  "scope": "Simplify four Boolean tile-colour branches using direct numeral normalization",
  "validation": "Paired target and sole tracked direct Lean client TilingRows compile using the source-matched RunTrace provider. Client object bytes differ but target/client name/type/axiom and simp/instance reports match with both objects pinned. Selected candidate adds no warnings.",
  "limitations": [
    "The project, BusyBeaver, Foundation and Mathlib transitive closure was not rebuilt; direct RunTrace source/object match comes from prior producer receipts.",
    "The superseded candidate compiled but introduced two unnecessary-sequencing warnings; its source, logs, timing and receipts are retained, while selected candidate avoids these. Original output/log paths were reused, and saved superseded compiled objects are excluded.",
    "Single shared-load timing pairs are not general benchmarks. Matching namespace/registration reports do not establish equality of proof bodies, every persistent extension or untested downstream behavior.",
    "Compiled objects are excluded; recorded hashes and first-provider paths require external objects for independent byte verification."
  ],
